[Options]

[ai5PriestCaptured]
<h2>You receive a message from your ally:</h2>
<p>Ally, I desparately need your help.  I have no money and I have been captured.  Save me!

[ai5PriestDead]
<h2>You receive a message from the Furies</h2>
<p>Don't worry about your friend, for you will soon join him.

[ai2PriestDead]
$Menu=~[IwindWalker.1]Wind,GetTechnology,137

[ai3PriestDead]
$Menu=~[IwindBlocker.1]Wind,GetTechnology,142

[A.]
<h2>Low Priests Rise to the Call, Allied Version</h2>
<i>"I will aid you all I can, before I turn traitor."<br>
--Low Priest of Thunder</i>
<p>You have chosen to ally with one of the enemy.  Was that the wrong choice?  Only a battle will tell.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
You fought well brave priest.

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Tourney

[Failed]
<h2>You have failed!</h2>
<i>Next time don't trust the enemy.</i>
<p>
The Furies are feeling lenient towards you because of their lopsided victory.  You are given a second chance.

$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Guard

[END]
